1. Executive Summary

Project owners often know they need creative work but struggle to identify the right service, visual direction, or creative professional. Current experiences are fragmented across template libraries, portfolio platforms, freelance marketplaces, messaging tools, and project-management systems.

TENTORA brings these activities into one curated journey. It begins with the client's industry and creative need, then offers fast and visible ways to move forward:

browse and edit a ready design created by a verified creative;

describe a need and use AI to discover a suitable template or starting point; or

discover a visual taste profile and work with a compatible creative, studio, or coordinated team.

These are presented as clear customer entry points, while the underlying delivery model remains organized around two connected product paths:

Product path

Intended outcome

Design Now

A fast, editable, ready-to-use creative result

Work With a Creative

An original or professionally developed creative solution

TENTORA does not position AI as a replacement for creative professionals. AI reduces friction, interprets intent, recommends relevant work, assists permitted customization, structures taste preferences, and improves matching and project handoff.

