Existing platforms often force these needs through the same journey. TENTORA separates them while allowing clients to move between them without restarting.

5. TENTORA Concept

TENTORA is an AI-powered, curated creative-solutions platform that helps project owners move from a creative need to a usable result through a visual, simple, and organized experience.

The platform begins with the client's project sector and required service—not with an open, unfiltered directory of creative profiles.

5.1 Customer entry points

The public experience exposes three direct entry points:

Ready Designs — browse editable templates created by verified creatives.

Create with AI — describe a need and receive relevant templates, structured starting points, or recommended next actions.

Work With a Creative — discover a visual direction and work with a compatible creative, studio, or team.

Explore Creatives remains available as a discovery route for users who prefer to browse portfolios and creative profiles directly.

